//
// Device-specific parts for TB375FC, one system_ext app running as android.uid.system:
//  - touch: mirrors Settings.Secure.DOUBLE_TAP_TO_WAKE to /proc/gesture_control (mtkpower
//    ignores Mode.DOUBLE_TAP_TO_WAKE), passes the display rotation to the Novatek edge
//    rejection (/proc/panel_direction) and toggles the Novatek touch game mode;
//  - display: caps the panel at 120 Hz while the active pen is in use (stock: MediaTek
//    SurfaceFlinger PenTimer, which AOSP SurfaceFlinger lacks) and optionally at 30 Hz while
//    LineageOS reading mode is on;
//  - color: screen color mode (Standard, Vivid, or Disabled for the vendor defaults), color
//    temperature, picture adjustment and MediaTek's video picture enhancements (sharpening,
//    ultra resolution, dynamic contrast, video color) through the MediaTek picture quality
//    service (stock: ZUI ZuiDisplayService in services.jar), colors per app if chosen; sample
//    pictures and hardware-decoded sample clips (MediaPlayer on a SurfaceView) to judge them by;
//  - pen: turns on the Novatek touch controller's pen mode (/proc/support_pen) while a Lenovo
//    pen is paired (stock: ZUI BluetoothPenConnectPolicy in services.jar) and notifies when the
//    pen connects or disconnects;
//  - cover: applies the stock folio-cover policy (light sensor check, sleep, lock) to the lid
//    switch reported by the patched hall.ko (docs/hall-ko-lid-switch.md);
//  - keyboard: notifies when the folio keyboard connects or disconnects, and disables it and its
//    touchpad while it is folded behind the tablet, letting the on-screen keyboard show meanwhile
//    (stock: ZUI KeyboardShortcutController). The fold handling is the KeyHandler that
//    PhoneWindowManager loads into system_server from this APK (overlay/LineageSdkDeviceOverlay),
//    not a service of the app; proguard.flags keeps it from being shrunk away.
//  - audio: rotates the speaker channels with the display (stock gsensor_rotation);
//  - dolby: the stock ZUI Dolby Atmos settings on top of the vendor daxService, with a graphic
//    equalizer shared by the Dynamic, Movie and Music modes;
//  - perf: per-app performance profiles: the foreground app goes to the MediaTek power HAL
//    (IMtkpower_applist, as stock system_server does) or a custom power HAL lock is held for it;
//  - memory: RAM expansion choices for mmd's zram writeback and compression algorithm.
// Its screens are listed on its Settings homepage entry and placed in the Display, Sound,
// Battery, Connected devices and System pages of Settings.
// Not privileged: uid 1000 already passes every permission check, and a priv-app would need
// privapp-permissions entries.

android_app {
    name: "DeviceParts",
    owner: "lineage",

    srcs: ["src/**/*.java"],
    resource_dirs: ["res"],
    manifest: "AndroidManifest.xml",

    platform_apis: true,
    certificate: "platform",
    system_ext_specific: true,

    static_libs: [
        "SettingsLibCollapsingToolbarBaseActivity",
        "SettingsLibMainSwitchPreference",
        "SettingsLibSelectorWithWidgetPreference",
        "SettingsLibSettingsTheme",
        "androidx.preference_preference",
        "com.google.android.material_material",
        "org.lineageos.platform.internal",
    ],

    optimize: {
        proguard_flags_files: ["proguard.flags"],
    },
}
